  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MF4-02 Building Climate Resilience in Fiji and Cook Islands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation International Aotearoa&#xa0;will work with in-country partners to&#xa0;improve climate resilience of Indigenous peoples and local communities (IPLC) in Fiji and Cook Islands through fostering enabling and empowering conditions, particularly with youth engagement, to sustainably manage their resources using customary approaches.</narrative>
  </description>
